{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1087", "sample_idx": 12, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "i think \"the social network\" is a very interesting movie. it tells the story of how facebook was created and the problems that the founder, mark zuckerberg, faced. the movie shows how mark, who was a student at harvard university, created a website called \"facemash\" which became very popular. then, he was asked to create a social network website for harvard students, which later became facebook.\n\nthe movie also shows the legal issues that mark faced when his friends eduard saveliev and the winn twins claimed that mark stole their idea. there are many court scenes in the movie where mark has to defend himself.\n\ni liked the acting in the movie very much. jesse eisenberg played the role of mark zuckerberg very well. he showed how mark was very smart but also very awkward in social situations. andrew garfield played the role of eduard saveliev, mark's friend who helped him start facebook. he showed how eduard felt betrayed by mark.\n\nthe music in the movie was also very good. it was composed by trent reznor and atticus ross. the music made the movie more exciting and emotional.\n\ni think the director, david fincher, did a very good job. he showed the story in a very interesting way, moving back and forth between the creation of facebook and the legal problems. the screenplay by aaron sorkin was also very good. the dialogue was very fast and clever, which made the movie more enjoyable.\n\noverall, i think \"the social network\" is a great movie. it tells an interesting story, has good acting, music, and direction. i would recommend it to anyone who likes movies about technology and business.\n\n**rating: 4.5 out of 5**\n\n**positives:**\n- interesting story\n- good acting\n- good music\n- good direction\n\n**negatives:**\n- some people might find the legal scenes a bit boring\n- the movie does not show the full story of facebook, only the beginning", "logprobs": [{"token": "i", "logprob": -0.04083649069070816}, {"token": " think", "logprob": -2.5719144344329834}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.07658042013645172}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -1.7881377516459906e-06}, {"token": " network", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "\"", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0011538759572431445}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0038171776104718447}, {"token": " very", "logprob": -1.1174474954605103}, {"token": " interesting", "logprob": -0.3154170513153076}, {"token": " movie", "logprob": -0.020570162683725357}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0028007111977785826}, {"token": " it", "logprob": -0.03416386991739273}, {"token": " tells", "logprob": -0.3766636550426483}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.9550132492440753e-05}, {"token": " story", "logprob": -1.0490362910786644e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00016199229867197573}, {"token": " how", "logprob": -0.014336442574858665}, {"token": " facebook", "logprob": -0.049022380262613297}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -0.08633771538734436}, {"token": " created", "logprob": -0.004862270317971706}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.22612838447093964}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -2.5510462364763953e-05}, {"token": " problems", "logprob": -0.0007907600956968963}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.1430530995130539}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.6589068174362183}, {"token": " founder", "logprob": -0.14730742573738098}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0034197440836578608}, {"token": " mark", "logprob": -2.4199192921514623e-05}, {"token": " z", "logprob": -0.00011252723925281316}, {"token": "ucker", "logprob": -0.00415094243362546}, {"token": "berg", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": " faced", "logprob": -0.005237785633653402}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.251991868019104}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.02677